  {
    "id": 1022003090010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "──優勝したら、何かがすごく\r\n変わるってわけじゃ、無いかもしれない……って",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お、思ってはいましたけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ほ、ほんとに、ほとんど\r\n今までと変わらないですよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、だからこそこうやって\r\nこつこつ挨拶回りするのが、大事なんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "目標に、近づいていくためにはさ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、それは……\r\n……そうかもしれないですけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
