  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "──あれ、２８３さんじゃないですか！\r\nどうしたんですか今日は",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、お世話になってます\r\n今日はぜひご挨拶させていただきたくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ほら、小糸",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……え、えっと……！\r\nは、はじめまして２８３プロの福ま──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "ああ！\r\n福丸小糸ちゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴぇ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご存知でしたか……！\r\nありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "何言ってるの、当たり前でしょ\r\n見てたよ『G.R.A.D.』！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "最初は２８３さんの子だなーってくらいしか\r\n思ってなかったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "優勝だもんなー！\r\nすごいじゃない！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "これから忙しくなっちゃうんじゃないー？\r\nその前に、うちの番組にも遊びに来てよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……ほ、本当ですか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "TV局のディレクター",
    "text": "うんうん、また連絡しますんで！\r\nそれじゃねー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ありがとうございます！\r\nぜひ、よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090090,
