  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸、これはさ……\r\n結構、大きな変化だって、言えるんじゃないか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……！\r\nだ、だって……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あのディレクターさん\r\nわ、わたしの名前、知ってましたよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200309/1022003090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それだけじゃない\r\n番組に来てくれって、言ってただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003090120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……！\r\nあ、えっと、ど、どうしましょう……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
